flowchart TD
    Start[Need cross-cutting behavior?] --> Whole{Needs whole HTTP pipeline?}
    Whole -->|Yes| Middleware[Use middleware]
    Whole -->|No| Mvc{Only MVC action concern?}
    Mvc -->|Yes| Filter[Use filters]
    Mvc -->|No| Endpoint{Endpoint metadata or minimal API?}
    Endpoint -->|Yes| EndpointFilter[Use endpoint filters]
    Endpoint -->|No| Service[Use application service or decorator]
